From c52ea632b9df2b695b8ad68689752056764f1739 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:05:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] hunt stress0: the second defect's schedule forced, and
 where each cut of an overlay came from

hunt_cut_forced files a key's cut against a partition, rewrites the partition with one key in and one out under the same fences, count and ends, and builds the block: the filed cut is one rank behind, and cut_known asserts. The silent variant has the stale cut still ahead of the walk, and the scan answers a wrong record under the key.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
